> odd(r: u64 in 1..65535) = r & 1
> range odd
range of odd -> u64:
  0..1
  fits in u1
  over all 65535 points of the domain
> odd32(r: u32 in 1..65535) = r & 1
> range odd32
range of odd32 -> u32:
  0..1
  fits in u1
  over all 65535 points of the domain
> q(a: u64 in 1..16, b: u64 in 1..64, c: u64 in 0..5, d: u64 in 0..5, e: u64 in 1..16) = (a * b * e) / (c + d + 1)
> q2(a: u64 in 1..16, b: u64 in 1..64, c: u64 in 0..5, d: u64 in 0..5, e: u64 in 1..16) = (e * b * a) / (d + c + 1)
> equiv q q2
q and q2 are equal on the domain of q (exhaustive)
> pr(a: u64 in 1..16, b: u64 in 1..64, c: u64 in 0..5, d: u64 in 0..5, e: u64 in 1..16) = a * b * (c + 1) * (d + 1) * e
> range pr
range of pr -> u64:
  1..589824
  fits in u20
  over all 589824 points of the domain
> big(x: u64) = x & 1
> range big
range of big -> u64:
  0..1
  fits in u1
  sampled 65536 points (domain has 2^64 or more points); not exhaustive
  sound bound (intervals): 0..1
